      "id": 4350114,
      "name": "[Blueprint] Etheric Phantom: Rampant Brute",
      "desc": "Use this Blueprint at the Smart Workshop to unlock the recipe for this item.\n\nItem Effect: Use this item to transform into a phantom of the <color=#FFAF2C>Rampant Brute</color>, pulling nearby enemies into the center of a small area. It deals DMG equal to <color=#2BAD00>100%</color>/<color=#2BAD00>30%</color>/<color=#2BAD00>10%</color> of Max HP to normal/elite/boss enemies, respectively, and deals <color=#2BAD00>30%</color> additional DMG to enemies above 50% HP. If it pulls 3 or more enemies, all normal and elite enemies pulled are instantly eliminated.",
